rders_with_item": 370, "rate": 0.0054, "amount": 80, "status": "ok"}], "legend": "unit_next＝新費率下每賣一份實拿幾元；status: loss＝賠錢, thin＝幾乎沒賺；ads 的 loss＝就算帶來的單全算廣告功勞也不划算, doubt＝若一半的單本來就會來則不划算"}, "t": 24.1}, {"i": 7, "thought": "有問題的品項有 A 牛肉湯麵、A 榨菜肉絲麵（招牌，最多漲 10 元）、B 牛肉湯麵、B 榨菜肉絲麵、B 燙青菜，先用 price_options 看各種售價的試算。", "tool": "price_options", "args": {"targets": [["A", "牛肉湯麵"], ["A", "榨菜肉絲麵"], ["B", "牛肉湯麵"], ["B", "榨菜肉絲麵"], ["B", "燙青菜"]]}, "result": {"options": [{"platform": "A", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "current_price": 110.0, "max_allowed_price": 130, "can_delist": true, "options": [{"price": 115.0, "unit_after": 0.8, "est_month_delta": 235}, {"price": 120.0, "unit_after": 3.9, "est_month_delta": 440}, {"price": 125.0, "unit_after": 6.9, "est_month_delta": 614}, {"price": 130.0, "unit_after": 10.0, "est_month_delta": 758}], "delist_est_month_delta": 724}, {"platform": "A", "item": "榨菜肉絲麵", "current_price": 80.0, "max_allowed_price": 90, "can_delist": false, "options": [{"price": 85.0, "unit_after": 0.3, "est_month_delta": 1011}, {"price": 90.0, "unit_after": 3.4, "est_month_delta": 1842}], "delist_est_month_delta": 3006}, {"platform": "B", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "current_price": 125.0, "max_allowed_price": 150, "can_delist": true, "options": [{"price": 130.0, "unit_after": 9.3, "est_month_delta": 161}, {"price": 135.0, "unit_after": 12.4, "est_month_delta": 298}, {"price": 140.0, "unit_after": 15.4, "est_month_delta": 411}, {"price": 145.0, "unit_after": 18.5, "est_month_delta": 500}, {"price": 150.0, "unit_after": 21.5, "est_month_delta": 565}], "delist_est_month_delta": -158}, {"platform": "B", "item": "榨菜肉絲麵", "current_price": 95.0, "max_allowed_price": 105, "can_delist": false, "options": [{"price": 100.0, "unit_after": 9.0, "est_month_delta": 681}, {"price": 105.0, "unit_after": 12.1, "est_month_delta": 1223}], "delist_est_month_delta": -435}, {"platform": "B", "item": "燙青菜", "current_price": 40.0, "max_allowed_price": 45, "can_delist": true, "options": [{"price": 45.0, "unit_after": 0.5, "